    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, but I also want to make sure I'm being objective for the paper. some people argue that socioeconomic status (SES) is the main driver, but there are others who suggest that environmental or even cultural factors play a larger role that isn't just about money. can you elaborate on those perspectives? like, what are the arguments regarding how different cultural values or home environments might impact test performance regardless of income?",
